  "body": "Held and treasured by the same family for over 35 years, this single-level home is now offered to the market as a deceased estate. Tucked privately away in a prime Eastern Beach address, this home presents an extraordinary blank canvas ready for you to add value, refresh, and make it your own.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a practical and functional floor plan that has stood the test of time. The home features three comfortable bedrooms and an open-plan kitchen and dining area that flows smoothly into a generous living room. Large picture windows and sliding doors fill the lounge with natural light and open directly out to private patio areas and mature grounds, creating a lovely sunny setting for entertaining friends and family. \r\nCatering to everyday convenience, the family bathroom is cleverly laid out with a separate bathtub and vanity room, an independent shower room, and an adjoining separate toilet-ideal for busy mornings. A dedicated separate laundry, single garage, and plenty of off-street parking complete this home. \r\n\r\nThe location simply speaks for itself. Situated in-zone for world-class schooling including Macleans College, you are just a leisurely stroll from the golden sands and calm waters of Eastern Beach. Enjoy weekend coffees at the local cafes, take a short drive to the bustling Howick Village for boutique shops and Saturday markets, or head down to Half Moon Bay Marina for waterfront dining and regular ferry services straight into the Auckland CBD. \r\n\r\nOpportunities with this much potential in such an exceptional coastal position are increasingly difficult to find. Whether you are looking for your next family home, an investment, or a rewarding renovation project, this is one you simply must inspect. \r\n\r\nMichael and the team welcome you to visit our open home or call us for a private viewing.",
